"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
1656,"**
Narrated to us Yusuf ibn Musa, narrated to us Jarir, on the authority of Yahya ibn Sa'id al-Ansari, on the authority of al-Qasim ibn Muhammad, on the authority of Ibn 'Umar (RA), who said:

""We used to be with the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) during a journey. When it was a dark night or a rainy night, the caller of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) would call out or announce: 'Pray in your dwellings.'"" [Sahih]"
